will give some remarks

00:39:05.380 --> 00:39:08.640
and then introduce our keynote
speaker, the honorable Kweisi

00:39:08.640 --> 00:39:09.920
Mfume.

00:39:09.920 --> 00:39:11.628
President Vest?

00:39:11.628 --> 00:39:15.016
