00:39:47.800 --> 00:39:51.970
community who have joined
with us for today's program.

00:39:51.970 --> 00:39:53.830
From the Cambridge
City Council, I'm

00:39:53.830 --> 00:39:56.500
very pleased to welcome
our current mayor, Frank

00:39:56.500 --> 00:40:01.000
[INAUDIBLE],, and also his
predecessor, City Councilor Ken

00:40:01.000 --> 00:40:02.770
Reeves.

00:40:02.770 --> 00:40:05.110
We also are very pleased
to have with us--

00:40:05.110 --> 00:40:08.561
[APPLAUSE]

00:40:12.510 --> 00:40:16.220
We also are very pleased to
